        <p class="mis-lead">A district that is not measured, an organization that cannot sustain itself, evidence nobody is reading. Those are the three conversations I am good at.</p>
        <div class="mis-acciones">
          <a class="mis-btn" href="mailto:jgutierrez@jpasesorescr.com">Write to me</a>
          <a class="mis-btn mis-fantasma" href="https://linkedin.com/in/emmanuelgpcr" target="_blank">LinkedIn &#8599;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mis-lienzo mis-deco" id="mis-hero-cont-en"></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="mis-blq mis-panel"><div class="mis-env">
      <div class="mis-kick">Channels</div>
