      <div class="mis-kick">Before writing</div>
      <h2 class="mis-tit">What helps me answer well</h2>
      <div class="mis-rej">
        <div class="mis-nodo"><i class="mis-pt"></i><span class="mis-et">01</span><h3>The decision at stake</h3><p>Tell me which decision depends on this work, and when it has to be made.</p><div class="mis-barras"><i></i><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="mis-nodo"><i class="mis-pt"></i><span class="mis-et">02</span><h3>What data already exists</h3><p>Even if it is messy. Half of the work is usually already in a spreadsheet somewhere.</p><div class="mis-barras"><i></i><i></i></div></div>
        <div class="mis-nodo"><i class="mis-pt mis-esp"></i><span class="mis-et">03</span><h3>Who has to keep using it</h3><p>If nobody stays behind to run it, we are building the wrong thing.</p><div class="mis-barras"><i></i><i></i></div></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="mis-cierre"><div class="mis-env">
      <div class="mis-kick">Location</div>
      <h2>Costa Rica, working across Central America</h2>
      <p>JP Asesores S.R.L. operates from Costa Rica, available for remote work, scheduled field visits and hybrid arrangements according to each project's needs.</p>
      <div class="mis-acciones">
        <a class="mis-btn" href="mailto:jgutierrez@jpasesorescr.com">Start a conversation</a>
        <a class="mis-txt" href="/files/emmanuel-gutierrez.vcf" download>Save contact card</a>
      </div>
    </div></section>
  </div>
  </div>

